undational educational theories. Experienced faculty members mentor teacher-trainees through immersive classroom learning, micro-teaching sessions, and structured internships at reputed partner schools across Vellore district. State-of-the-art facilities, including well-equipped science and computer laboratories, a comprehensive library, and vibrant sports grounds, ensure that students receive a well-rounded training experience.\\n\\nCommitted to fostering moral values, social responsibility, and professional excellence, Durai Murugan College of Education continues to supply competent, compassionate, and visionary teachers to modern classrooms. The institution emphasizes critical thinking, digital literacy in education, and community engagement, preparing graduates to navigate and excel in contemporary academic landscapes.","highlights":["Approved by NCTE and affiliated with Thiruvalluvar University","Spacious 10-acre serene campus equipped with modern infrastructure","Dedicated faculty with extensive research and pedagogical expertise","Comprehensive practical training and school internship programs","Advanced educational technology and computer lab facilities","Active placement and career guidance cell for aspiring teachers","Regular organization of national seminars, workshops, and cultural events","Robust library stocked with thousands of reference books and journals","Strong emphasis on co-curricular activities, sports, and community outreach","Affordable fee structure aligned with state norms for quality teacher education"],"departments":[{"name":"Bachelor of Education (B.Ed)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":85,"avgPackage":"2.5 LPA","highestPackage":"4.0 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Eligibility Check","desc":"Candidates must possess a graduation or postgraduate degree in arts, science, or engineering with a minimum of 50% aggregate marks."},{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Fill out the application form available online through the college portal or offline at the campus admission office."},{"title":"Merit Determination","desc":"Selections are strictly based on merit, considering marks secured in the qualifying degree examination as per TN Government rules."},{"title":"Counselling Session","desc":"Shortlisted candidates participate in document verification and counseling conducted by the admission committee."},{"title":"Final Enrollment","desc":"Pay the prescribed tuition fees to confirm admission and secure enrollment into the B.Ed program."}],"scholarships":["First Graduate Tuition Fee Concession","Post Matric Scholarship for SC/ST Students","BC/MBC State Government Scholarship","Minority Welfare Scholarship","Differently Abled Student Financial Assistance","Ex-Servicemen Ward Educational Concession","Merit-Based Institutional Waiver","Trust Endowment Awards for Toppers"],"events":["Annual Sports Meet","Teacher''s Day Celebrations","National Science Day Exhibition","Annual Cultural Fest - Utsav","Pedagogical Workshop Series","Community Health and Literacy Camp"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"130 km (Chennai International Airport)","railway":"7 km (Katpadi Junction)","bustand":"6 km (Vellore New Bus Stand)","metro":"N/A","hospital":"3 km (CMI Hospital Katpadi)"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate accommodation for men and women","24/7 Security and CCTV surveillance","Wi-Fi connectivity across hostel blocks","Nutritious vegetarian and non-vegetarian mess food","Reading room and indoor games facilities","Uninterrupted power supply with backup generators","Medical assistance and first aid on call","Clean drinking water via RO purification systems"],"technicalClubs":["ICT in Education Club","Science Innovators Forum","Mathematics Pedagogy Cell","Language and Literacy Club"],"culturalClubs":["Fine Arts and Craft Club","Drama and Theatre Society","Music and Choir Troupe","Literary and Debating Society"],"communityService":["National Service Scheme (NSS)","Red Ribbon Club (RRC)","Adult Literacy Outreach Program","Environmental Awareness Cleanliness Drives","Health and Hygiene Rural Camps","Blood Donation Camps"]}'),
