 Language, Educational Technology, and Work Experience laboratories, all fully equipped to meet rigorous regulatory standards. The central library features an extensive array of titles, reference books, and educational journals, accommodating a high percentage of students simultaneously for individual study and group research.\\n\\nCommitted to producing highly competent, ethically grounded educators, Vidhyalaya College of Education balances theoretical instruction with rigorous teaching practices and interactive co-curricular activities. Experienced faculty members guide pre-service teachers to develop effective classroom strategies, modern digital resource utilization, and deep social responsibility.","highlights":["Approved by NCTE and affiliated with Tamil Nadu Teachers Education University","Established in 2008 with over 15 years of excellence in teacher training","Peaceful, pollution-free campus setting ideal for focused learning","Well-equipped discipline-specific labs: Psychology, Science, Language & Tech","Spacious central library with extensive book banks and journal subscriptions","Strong emphasis on practical teaching methodology and school placements","Experienced and dedicated faculty team focused on student-centered mentoring","Regular organization of sports, cultural symposia, and academic workshops","Active student support systems and placement guidance cell","Affordable tuition framework complying with Tamil Nadu state stipulations"],"departments":[{"name":"Bachelor of Education (B.Ed)","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-