graduate, and doctoral programs across arts, science, and commerce streams.\\n\\nSpread across a serene 11-acre campus, the institution provides an encouraging and disciplined academic environment equipped with modern laboratories, a comprehensive library, and dedicated faculty members. Emphasis is placed not only on academic rigor but also on moral values, leadership training, and skill development to ensure holistic personality development for every student.\\n\\nThrough various community engagement initiatives, extension activities, and robust placement support, the college empowers its students to become self-reliant professionals, entrepreneurs, and responsible citizens. By adhering strictly to government norms of inclusive education, it remains a beacon of hope and transformation for young women aspiring to excel in diverse fields of knowledge.","highlights":["Established in 1998 under the aegis of the Government of Tamil Nadu","Affiliated with Mother Teresa Women''s University, Kodaikanal","Dedicated exclusively to women''s higher education and empowerment","Sprawling 11-acre eco-friendly rural campus with modern facilities","Qualified and experienced faculty committed to student mentorship","Active National Service Scheme (NSS) and Youth Red Cross units","Affordable fee structure adhering fully to state government norms","Well-stocked central library with digital resources and reading spaces","Active placement and career guidance cell conducting employability training","Regular organization of national seminars, workshops, and skill programs"],"departments":[{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PG"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PG"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":65,"avgPackage":"1.8 LPA","highestPackage":"3.2 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Notification & Application","desc":"Applications are invited online through the official Tamil Nadu government arts admission portal following 12th-grade results."},{"title":"Merit List Preparation","desc":"Rank lists are prepared purely on the basis of academic marks secured in the qualifying higher secondary examinations."},{"title":"Counseling Sessions","desc":"Candidates are called for transparent offline/online counseling based on communal reservation norms mandated by the state."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Original certificates including transfer, community, and mark sheets are verified meticulously by the admission committee."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Final admission is confirmed upon payment of prescribed government tuition fees and formal enrollment."}],"scholarships":["Post Matric Scholarship for SC/ST Students","Chief Minister''s Uzhavar Pathukappu Thittam Scholarship","Tamil Nadu First Graduate Tuition Fee Concession","National Scholarship Portal (NSP) Schemes","Backward Classes and Most Backward Classes Scholarship","Minority Welfare Scholarship","Blind/Differently Abled State Scholarship","UGC Single Girl Child Fellowship for Research"],"events":["Annual Cultural Fest - Kalai Vizha","National Science Day Celebrations","Independence Day & Republic Day Parades","College Annual Sports Meet","Departmental Symposiums and Quiz Competitions","Entrepreneurship Awareness Camps"],"distanc