shine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sakthi-College-of-Arts-and-Science-for-Women_6_11zon-300x114.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Sakthi College of Arts and Science for Women - CollegeShine","description":"Sakthi College of Arts and Science for Women is a private un-aided arts & science college in Oddanchatram established in 2009. Empowering Women Through.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sakthi-College-of-Arts-and-Science-for-Women_6_11zon-300x114.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Sakthi College of Arts and Science for Women","shortName":"SCASW","tagline":"Empowering Women Through Quality Education and Holistic Development","category":"arts-science","type":"Private","ownership":"Private Un-Aided","established":2009,"location":"Oddanchatram","district":"Dindigul","address":"Sakthi Nagar, Dindigul-Palani Main Road, Palakanuthu PO, Oddanchatram, Dindigul, Tamil Nadu - 624619","mapLink":"https://maps.google.com/?q=Sakthi+College+of+Arts+and+Science+for+Women+Oddanchatram","mapQuery":"Sakthi College of Arts and Science for Women Oddanchatram","website":"http://scasw.sakthicollege.ac.in/","phone":"+91 9715284358","email":"scas2009@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sakthi-College-of-Arts-and-Science-for-Women_6_11zon-300x114.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"Mother Teresa Women''s University, Kodaikanal","accreditation":["NAAC","AISHE","UGC Recognized","Mother Teresa Women''s University"],"about":"Sakthi College of Arts and Science for Women, located in Oddanchatram, Dindigul district, is a premier institution dedicated exclusively to women''s higher education. Established in 2009 under the aegis of the Sowdamman Charitable Trust, the college is affiliated with Mother Teresa Women''s University, Kodaikanal. Over the years, the institution has grown into a vibrant academic center offering diverse undergraduate, postgraduate, and research programs across arts, science, commerce, and management streams.\\n\\nThe campus is equipped with modern infrastructure, including advanced science and computer laboratories, a well-stocked digital library, spacious classrooms, and secure hostel facilities. The faculty members are highly experienced and committed to fostering analytical thinking, moral values, and academic distinction among students. Through rigorous training sessions, skill development initiatives, and continuous mentorship, the college ensures that young women are well-prepared for professional careers and higher education.\\n\\nIn addition to academics, Sakthi College places strong emphasis on co-curricular activities, community outreach through NSS, and leadership development. The Institution Innovation Council (IIC) and dedicated placement cell work proactively to bridge the gap between classroom learning and industry requirements. By nurturing talent in a safe, inclusive, and empowering environment, SCASW continues to shape confident and independent women leaders of tomorrow.","highlights":["Exclusive women''s institution with secure and modern campus infrastructure","Affiliated with Mother Teresa Women''s University, Kodaikanal","Comprehensive range of UG, PG, and Research programs","Well-equipped laboratories and fully automated digital library","Active Career Development and Placement Cell with regular drives","Strong focus on skill development, entrepreneurship, and innovation (IIC)","Active student participation in NSS, YRC, and community service","Generous scholarships and fee concessions for meritorious students","Spacious multi-purpose auditorium and seminar halls","Holistic environment promoting sports, cultural clubs, and moral values"],"departments":[{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PG"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PG"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"Tamil","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Lab"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"Innovation Cell"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Digital Learning Centre"}],"placementRate":78,"avgPackage":"1.8 LPA","highestPackage":"3.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Candidates must apply online or offline via the college admission portal with accurate personal and academic details."},{"title":"Eligibility Verification","desc":"Applications are verified based on qualifying examination marks (10+2 for UG and Graduation for PG)."},{"title":"Merit List Publication","desc":"The college releases a transparent merit list based on government norms and university guidelines."},{"title":"Counseling & Interview","desc":"Shortlisted candidates and their parents attend an interaction session and counseling at the campus."},{"title":"Fee Payment & Enrollment","desc":"Final admission is confirmed upon document verification and payment of prescribed tuition fees."}],"scholarships":["Government Post Matric Scholarship for SC/ST/SCA students","BC/MBC/DNC State Government Scholarships","First Generation Graduate Tuition Fee Concession","Merit-based institutional scholarships for top scorers","Minority welfare state scholarships","Ex-Servicemen educational concessions","UBA and Trust-sponsored financial assistance","Sports quota fee waivers"],"events":["Annual Sports Meet","Cultural Fest - Sakthi Fiesta","National Science Day Celebrations","Women''s Day Special Symposium","Inter-Collegiate Technical Meet","Graduation Day Ceremony"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Madurai Airport - 85 km","railway":"Dindigul Junction - 22 km","bustand":"Oddanchatram Bus Stand - 3 km","metro":"Not Applicable","hospital":"On-Campus Health Center & Holy Cross Hospital - 4 km"},"hostelFeatures":["Secure and well-furnished rooms for girls","24/7 security and biometric entry system","Nutritious and hygienic mess facility","Uninterrupted power supply and RO drinking water","Reading room and indoor games recreation","Wi-Fi connectivity inside hostel premises","Medical assistance on call","Clean and well-maintained sanitization blocks"],"technicalClubs":["Coding and Programming Club","IT Academy Chapter","Science Innovation Forum","Maths Wiz Club"],"culturalClubs":["Fine Arts and Dance Club","Music and Singing Club","Drama and Theatre Troupe","Literary and Debating Society","Photography and Media Club"],"communityService":["National Service Scheme (NSS)","Youth Red Cross (YRC)","Red Ribbon Club (RRC)","Unnat Bharat Abhiyan (UBA)","Eco and Green Campus Club","Health and Hygiene Awareness Cell"]}'),
