overnment high school, the college moved to its permanent campus on Namakkal-Mohanur Road in 1970-71 and today functions under Periyar University, Salem, holding a re-accredited B grade from NAAC.\\n\\nThe institution now offers 14 undergraduate programmes, 11 postgraduate programmes, and 8 each of M.Phil and Ph.D programmes across departments such as English, Economics, Physics, Chemistry and Botany. Its emblem, featuring a notebook, pen and traditional lamp alongside Namakkal''s rock fort and temples, reflects the college''s rootedness in local heritage alongside its educational mission. The college continues to serve first-generation learners from Namakkal town and its surrounding rural taluks.","highlights":["Established 1968-69, named after former CM Arignar Anna","Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem","NAAC B grade (re-accredited)","Offers 14 UG, 11 PG, 8 M.Phil and 8 Ph.D programmes","Moved to permanent Mohanur Road campus in 1970-71"],"departments":[{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"}],"facilities":["Available"],"placementRate":36,"avgPackage":"≈₹60,000","highestPackage":"≈₹65,000","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":["Merit-based admission per Tamil Nadu Government / TNGASA norms","10+2 pass required for UG entry","Relevant Bachelor''s degree required for PG entry"],"scholarships":["Government Scholarship Support","Post Matric Scholarship Support","First Graduate Scholarship Support","BC / MBC Scholarship Support","SC / ST Scholarship Support","Minority Scholarship Support"],"events":["Academic Events","Cultural Events","Sports Activities","NSS Activities","NCC Activities","Student Development Programmes"],"distanceInfo":{"status":"Distance information is currently being updated"},"hostelFeatures":["Hostel Facility","Student Accommodation Support","Mess Facility","Basic Student Amenities","Hostel Information is currently being updated"],"technicalClubs":["Academic Clubs","Department Associations","Student Development Activities","Technical Club Details are currently being updated"],"culturalClubs":["Fine Arts Activities","Cultural Programmes","College Union Activities","Student Cultural Events"],"communityService":["NSS","NCC","Community Outreach Activities","Social Awareness Programmes","Student Welfare Activities"]}'),
