"Affiliated to Periyar University"],"about":"Namakkal Kavignar Ramalingam Government Arts College for Women is a government women''s arts and science college located in Namakkal, Tamil Nadu. Established in 1969, the institution provides higher education opportunities exclusively for women and functions as an affiliated college of Periyar University, Salem. The institution is recognised under UGC 2(f) and 12(B), and its official records show that it has undergone multiple NAAC accreditation cycles, with Cycle III receiving an A grade with a CGPA of 3.18 in 2016.\\n\\nThe college offers a broad range of undergraduate, postgraduate and research programmes across Arts, Commerce and Science disciplines. Its academic programmes include Tamil, English, History, Economics, Commerce, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Botany, Zoology, Computer Science, Microbiology and Nutrition & Dietetics at UG level, together with postgraduate and research programmes. The institution also supports student development through sports, NSS, Youth Red Cross, Red Ribbon Club, research activities, welfare schemes and skill-development initiatives.","highlights":["Government women''s college established in 1969","Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem","NAAC A Grade with CGPA 3.18","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) recognised institution","13 undergraduate programmes","11 postgraduate programmes","6 research programme offerings","Women-focused higher education institution","Government welfare and skill-development programmes","NSS, YRC and RRC activities","Extensive sports and physical education facilities","Hostel facility available"],"departments":[{"name":"B.A. Tamil","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. English","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. History","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. Economics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Botany","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Zoology","level"