/07/Government-Arts-College-for-Men-Krishnagiri_7_11zon.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Government Arts College for Women, Krishnagiri - CollegeShine","description":"Government Arts College for Women, Krishnagiri is a government arts & science college in Rayakotta Road, Krishnagiri established in 1992. Empowering women of.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Government-Arts-College-for-Men-Krishnagiri_7_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Government Arts College for Women, Krishnagiri","shortName":"GACW Krishnagiri","tagline":"Empowering women of Krishnagiri district since 1992","category":"arts-science","type":"Degree College (Women)","ownership":"Government","established":"1992","location":"Rayakotta Road, Krishnagiri","district":"Krishnagiri","address":"Government Arts College for Women, Rayakotta Road, Krishnagiri - 635001/635002, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Government+Arts+College+for+Women+Krishnagiri","mapQuery":"Government Arts College for Women, Krishnagiri, Tamil Nadu 635002","website":"https://www.gacwkgi.org/","phone":"04343-225934","email":"gacwkgi@rediffmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Government-Arts-College-for-Men-Krishnagiri_7_11zon.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":[],"about":"Government Arts College for Women, Krishnagiri was established in 1992 to meet the higher-education needs of women in Krishnagiri district, many from underprivileged rural backgrounds. It began academic operations that year with 112 students, initially named Annai Sandhiya Government Arts College for Women per G.O. No. 800 dated 26/08/1993, before being renamed to its present title under Government Order No. 569 dated 12/01/1997. The college is affiliated 