 Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R. Government Arts and Science College, Palacode","openGraph":{"title":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R - CollegeShine","description":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R. Government Arts and Science College, Palacode is a government arts & science college in Palacode established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Bharat-Ratna-Puratchi-Thalaivar-Dr.-M.G.R.-Government-Arts-and-Science-College-Palacode-collegshine_6_11zon.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R - CollegeShine","description":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R. Government Arts and Science College, Palacode is a government arts & science college in Palacode established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Bharat-Ratna-Puratchi-Thalaivar-Dr.-M.G.R.-Government-Arts-and-Science-College-Palacode-collegshine_6_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R. Government Arts and Science College, Palacode","shortName":"Dr. MGR GASC Palacode","tagline":"Fulfilling Palacode''s long-standing demand for higher education since 2017","category":"arts-science","type":"Degree College","ownership":"Government","established":"2017","location":"Palacode","district":"Dharmapuri","address":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. MGR Government Arts and Science College, Palacode - 636808, Dharmapuri District, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dr+MGR+Government+Arts+and+Science+College+Palacode","mapQuery":"Dr MGR Government Arts and Science College, Palacode, Dharmapuri, Tamil Nadu 636808","website":"https://www.gascpalacode.org/","phone":" 093621 11546","email":"gascpalacode2017@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Bharat-Ratna-Puratchi-Thalaivar-Dr.-M.G.R.-Government-Arts-and-Science-College-Palacode-collegshine_6_11zon.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/27ArUxpNJog?si=Ak0T-5YJFkRAzKVq","affiliation":"Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":["Government Institution","Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem"],"about":"Bharat Ratna Puratchi Thalaivar Dr. M.G.R. Government Arts and Science College, Palacode was established on 24 July 2017 in response to the long-standing demand of the Palacode area for a local arts and science college. The college was formally named by then Chief Minister Edappadi K. Palaniswami during the Dr. MGR birth centenary function held in Dharmapuri district, in honour of former Chief Minister M.G. Ramachandran. The Dharmapuri District Co-operative Sugar Mill management, together with local farmers, allotted 5 acres of land within the Co-operative Society premises for the campus, and the college is affiliated to Periyar University, Salem.\\n\\nThe college began with eight undergraduate courses -- Tamil, English, History, Economics, Mathematics, Computer Science, BBA and Commerce -- and has since added programmes including Public Administration, Social Work and Physics. Facilities include separate boys'' and girls'' hostels, functional laboratories, a canteen, transport for students and staff, and a library, along with an auditorium for events and seminars. As one of the newer government colleges in Dharmapuri district, it primarily serves students from Palacode taluk who previously had to travel to Dharmapuri town or further for higher education.","highlights":["Established 24 July 2017, named after Dr. M.G. Ramachandran","Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem","5-acre campus allotted by Dharmapuri Co-operative Sugar Mill","Began with 8 UG courses; later added Social Work and Physics"],"departments":[{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"