ent Arts and Science College, Pappireddipatti is a government arts & science college in Pappireddipatti established in 2011. The first Sociology.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Government-Arts-and-Science-College-Pappireddipipatti-collegshine_2_11zon.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Government Arts and Science College - CollegeShine","description":"Government Arts and Science College, Pappireddipatti is a government arts & science college in Pappireddipatti established in 2011. The first Sociology.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Government-Arts-and-Science-College-Pappireddipipatti-collegshine_2_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Government Arts and Science College, Pappireddipatti","shortName":"GASC Pappireddipatti","tagline":"The first Sociology programme in Dharmapuri district, serving Pappireddipatti since 2011","category":"arts-science","type":"Degree College","ownership":"Government","established":2011,"location":"Pappireddipatti","district":"Dharmapuri","address":"Government Arts and Science College, Pappireddipatti (TK) & (PO), Dharmapuri - 636905, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Government+Arts+and+Science+College+Pappireddipatti","mapQuery":"Government Arts and Science College, Pappireddipatti, Dharmapuri, Tamil Nadu 636905","website":"https://www.gascprp.edu.in/","phone":"04346-246212","email":"gascprpatti@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Government-Arts-and-Science-College-Pappireddipipatti-collegshine_2_11zon.webp","videoUrl":null,"affiliation":"Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":["UGC 2(f) & 12(B) Recognized","Periyar University Affiliated","Government Institution","NIRF Data Submitted"],"about":"Government Arts and Science College, Pappireddipatti was established in 2011 as a Periyar University constituent college and later became a full-fledged Government Arts and Science College. The institution initially functioned from the Government Boys Higher Secondary School at Pappireddipatti and shifted to its present campus in 2015. The college is located near the Pappireddipatti Bus Stand at the foothills of the Shevaroy Hills and provides higher education opportunities to students from Pappireddipatti and surrounding areas.\\n\\nThe college initially offered five undergraduate programmes including B.A. Tamil, B.A. English, B.Com., B.Sc. Mathematics and B.Sc. Computer Science. B.Sc. Physics was introduced in 2016, postgraduate programmes in Tamil, English and Mathematics were introduced in 2017, and B.A. Sociology and M.Sc. Computer Science were introduced in 2020. The Tamil Department was recognised as a Research Department in 2020. The college is affiliated to Periyar University, Salem and is recognised under Sections 2(f) and 12(B) of the UGC Act, 1956.","highlights":["Established in 2011","Government Arts and Science College","Affiliated to Periyar University","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) Recognized","First B.A. Sociology programme in Dharmapuri district","6.21-acre campus","12 academic programmes","Research Department in Tamil","3,500+ library books","15 academic journals","31 magazines available in library","Active NSS, YRC and RRC units"],"departments":[{"name":"B.A. Tamil","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. English","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com. Commerce","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. Sociology","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.A. Tamil","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.A. English","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"Ph.D. Tamil","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-