andars-College-collegshine.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Kandaswami Kandar''s College | Namakkal - CollegeShine","description":"Kandaswami Kandar''s College is a private, government-aided arts & science college in Velur, Paramathi Velur, Namakkal District established in 1962. Charity.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Kandaswami-Kandars-College-collegshine.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Kandaswami Kandar''s College","shortName":"KKC Velur","tagline":"Charity, Devotion and Knowledge for Holistic Education","category":"arts-science","type":"Arts and Science College","ownership":"Private, Government-Aided","established":1962,"location":"Velur, Paramathi Velur, Namakkal District","district":"Namakkal","address":"16/1, P-Velur (T.K), Namakkal District - 638182, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kandaswami+Kandar%27s+College+Velur+Namakkal","mapQuery":"Kandaswami Kandar''s College, Paramathi Velur, Namakkal","website":"https://kkc.edu.in/","phone":"04268-220255 / 04268-222855","email":"kkcvelur1962@gmail.com","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Kandaswami-Kandars-College-collegshine.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":["NAAC B++ Grade","Periyar University Affiliated","UGC Recognised Institution"],"about":"Kandaswami Kandar''s College was established in 1962 in Velur, Namakkal District, with the objective of providing higher education opportunities to students from the rural and economically disadvantaged communities of the region. The University of Madras initially granted affiliation for Pre-University courses and subsequently extended affiliation to degree programmes. The college moved to its own campus in 1967, and the institution was formally opened by the then Chief Minister of Tamil Nadu, C.N. Annadurai. The college now has a 48-acre campus and has been affiliated with Periyar University, Salem since 1998.\\n\\nThe institution provides undergraduate, postgraduate and research education through aided and unaided programmes. Its academic departments include Tamil, English, Mathematics, Physics, Chemistry, Botany, Zoology, Economics, History, Commerce, Business Administration, Computer Science and Microbiology. The college also provides laboratory facilities, library services, smart classrooms, internet connectivity, hostel accommodation, transport, sports facilities and student-support activities. Its official website reports a dedicated Training and Placement Cell, 100% placement, more than 100 companies visiting the campus, 5,000+ students placed, 15,000+ successful alumni worldwide and a highest package of 12 LPA.","highlights":["48-acre campus","Established in 1962","Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem","NAAC B++ Grade accreditation","UG, PG, M.Phil and Ph.D programmes","100+ companies visited for recruitment","5000+ students placed","15000+ successful alumni worldwide","12 LPA highest package","Dedicated Training and Placement Cell","Separate Boys and Girls Hostel Facilities","Sports, NSS, NCC, YRC and RRC activities"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physical Education","level":"UG"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"Microbiology","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Internet"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Science Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Boys Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Girls Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Facility"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Ground"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Medical Facility"},{"icon":"ti-users","name":"Student Support Services"}],"placementRate":100,"avgPackage":"₹3.5 LPA","highestPackage":"₹12 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Candidates can apply through the college admission process for the selected undergraduate or postgraduate programme."},{"title":"Eligibility Verification","desc":"Applicants must satisfy the qualifying examination and programme-specific eligibility requirements prescribed by the college and Periyar University."},{"title":"Merit Selection","desc":"Eligible candidates are considered according to the admission and merit procedures applicable to the selected programme."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Selected students complete verification of academic certificates, transfer certificate, community certificate and other required documents."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"Candidates complete the prescribed fee payment and admission formalities to confirm their seat."},{"title":"Campus Enrollment","desc":"Students report to the college according to the joining schedule and complete the enrollment process."}],"scholarships":["Government Scholarship","Post Matric Scholarship","BC Scholarship","MBC Scholarship","SC Scholarship","ST Scholarship","Minority Scholarship","First Graduate Scholarship","Merit Scholarship"],"events":["Sports Day","Independence Day Celebration","Environmental Club Activities","NSS Activities","NCC Activities","Youth Red Cross Activities","Red Ribbon Club Activities","Student Cultural Activities","Industrial Visits","Career Development Programmes"],"distanceInfo":{"nearestBusStop":"Paramathi Velur Bus Stop","nearestRailway"