ce college in Natarajapuram, Komarapalayam established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/J.K.K.-Nataraja-College-of-Arts-Science-collegshine_5_11zon.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"J.K.K. Nataraja College of Arts & Science - CollegeShine","description":"J.K.K. Nataraja College of Arts & Science is a private, government-aided, autonomous arts & science college in Natarajapuram, Komarapalayam established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/J.K.K.-Nataraja-College-of-Arts-Science-collegshine_5_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"J.K.K. Nataraja College of Arts & Science","shortName":"JKKN CAS","tagline":"Love, Learn and Serve","category":"arts-science","type":"Arts and Science College (Autonomous)","ownership":"Private, Government-Aided, Autonomous","established":"1974","location":"Natarajapuram, Komarapalayam","district":"Namakkal","address":"JKKN College of Arts and Science, Natarajapuram, NH-544 (Salem to Coimbatore Highway), Komarapalayam, Namakkal District - 638183, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=JKKN+College+of+Arts+and+Science+Komarapalayam","mapQuery":"JKKN College of Arts and Science, Natarajapuram, Komarapalayam","website":"https://cas.jkkn.ac.in/","phone":"+91 9345855001","email":"info@jkkn.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/J.K.K.-Nataraja-College-of-Arts-Science-collegshine_5_11zon.webp","videoUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=FAKEVIDEO12345","affiliation":"Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":["NAAC Accredited","UGC Recognized, Autonomous"],"about":"JKKN College of Arts and Science is an autonomous, NAAC-accredited institution on NH-544 (Salem-Coimbatore Highway) in Komarapalayam, Namakkal district, part of the J.K.K. Rangammal Charitable Trust''s JKKN Institutions group founded in 1952. The college itself began in 1974 as Alamelu Angappan College for Women, established to benefit the wards of local weavers in the Komarapalayam weaving hub, and started as a government-aided college with around 100 students. It is now co-educational, affiliated to Periyar University, Salem, and holds autonomous academic status.\\n\\nThe college offers 27+ undergraduate, postgraduate, and doctoral programmes across Science, Commerce, IT, and Management on a 15-acre campus that is part of JKKN''s larger integrated 70-acre educational complex. According to the college''s official communications, it reports a 95% placement rate with recruiter partnerships including TCS, Infosys, and Wipro, though these figures are self-reported by the institution and were not independently verified through third-party data such as NIRF. Campus facilities include a library of roughly 25,771 volumes with INFLIBNET and National Digital Library membership, campus-wide Wi-Fi, hostel accommodation for both genders, and a cafeteria.","highlights":["Autonomous status under Periyar University","Self-reported 95% placement rate","27+ UG, PG, and PhD programmes","Part of the larger JKKN Institutions group (7 colleges, 2 schools)"],"departments":[{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"}],"facilities":["Library (25,771+ volumes)","Wi-Fi campus","Cafeteria","Hostel (boys and girls)","Auditorium (Vibrant Arangam)"],"placementRate":95,"avgPackage":null,"highestPackage":"Rs. 18 LPA (as claimed on official JKKN site)","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":["Applications open via unified JKKN Admissions portal (March each year)","Merit-based selection on qualifying exam scores","Counseling for course/eligibility guidance available via admissions office"],"scholarships":[],"events":["PULSE 2K26 New Year Cultural Celebration (31 December 2025)"],"distanceInfo":{"nearestCity":"Erode - approximately 22 km","nearestTown":"Tiruchengode - approximately 15 km","nearestAirport":"Coimbatore International Airport - approximately 80 km"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate hostels for boys and girls","Mess facility","Wi-Fi","24/7 security"],"technicalClubs":[],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":[]}'),
('salem-sowdeswari-college-women','salem-sowdeswari-college-women','Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College','Sowdeswari College','arts-science','Arts and Science College for Women','Private, Government-Aided','1975','Kondalampatti, Salem','Salem','Kondalampatti (PO), Salem - 636010, Tamil Nadu, India','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Salem+Sowdeswari+College+Kondalampatti+Salem','https://shrisowdesvariwomenscollege.org/','+91 427 2270537','ssc.sfcw2010@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Shri-Sowdeswari-Womens-College-formerly-Salem-Sowdeswari-College.webp','Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College | Salem - CollegeShine','Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College is a private, government-aided arts & science college in Kondalampatti, Salem established in 1975. Empowering Women Through.',NULL, '{"id":"salem-sowdeswari-college-women","seo":{"metaTitle":"Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College | Salem - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College is a private, government-aided arts & science college in Kondalampatti, Salem established in 1975. Empowering Women Through.","metaKeywords":["Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College","Sowdeswari College","Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College admission 2026","Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College fees","Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College courses","Arts & Science colleges in Salem","Kondalampatti","Salem","Salem","Arts & Science","Private","Government-Aided","Arts and Science College for Women","UGC Recognized","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) Recognized","AICTE Approved Programmes","Periyar University Affiliated","Tamil","English","Economics","Mathematics","Statistics"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College","openGraph":{"title":"Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College | Salem - CollegeShine","description":"Shri Sowdeswari Women''s College is a private, government-aided arts & science college in Kondalampatti, Salem established in 1975. Empowering Women Through.","image":"https://co