ce disciplines. The institution obtained UGC recognition in 1980 and became eligible under Sections 2(f) and 12(B) of the UGC Act. In 1997, affiliation of the college was transferred to the newly established Periyar University, Salem.\\n\\nThe institution was originally a co-educational college and, following Government approval received in 2022, began admitting only women students from the academic year 2022-23. The college currently provides aided and self-financing undergraduate and postgraduate programmes along with M.Phil and Ph.D research programmes in selected disciplines. Its campus provides classrooms, library facilities, laboratories, hostel accommodation, digital learning resources, student clubs, career counselling and placement activities. The college also conducts academic, cultural, sports, social-awareness and community-oriented programmes throughout the academic year.","highlights":["Established in 1975","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) Recognition","Affiliated to Periyar University","Women-only admission from 2022-23","Government-Aided and Self-Financing Wings","UG and PG Programmes","Research Programmes Available","Career Counselling and Placement Cell","Campus-Wide Learning Facilities","Student Hostel Facility","Digital E-Library Resources","Active Student Clubs and Activities"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PG"},{"name":"Economics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Statistics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"Electronics and Communication","level":"PG"},{"name":"Corporate Secretaryship","level":"UG"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"Biotechnology","level":"UG"},{"name":"Textile and Fashion Technology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Costume Design and Fashion","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Wi-Fi Enabled Campus"},{"icon":"t