al and Research Institution Trust. The co-educational institution is affiliated to Periyar University, Salem, and is located at Dr. M.G.R. Nagar in Hosur, Krishnagiri District. The college campus extends across approximately 250 acres and provides academic, residential, sports, research and student-support facilities. The institution has been re-accredited by NAAC with a B+ grade and is recognized under Sections 2(f) and 12(B) of the UGC Act.\\n\\nM.G.R. College offers undergraduate, postgraduate and doctoral programmes across computer science, artificial intelligence and data science, computer applications, commerce, biotechnology, microbiology, biochemistry, physics, chemistry, mathematics, hotel management, business administration, English and visual communication. The college also maintains dedicated research programmes in Tamil, Commerce, Biotechnology and Microbiology. Its campus facilities include laboratories, library resources, hostels, auditoriums, sports grounds, gymnasium, cafeteria and student-support services. The institution also operates a Career and Placement Counselling Cell and provides industry-oriented training programmes through organisations including IBM, NASSCOM, Barclays and Hindustan Unilever.","highlights":["250-acre green campus","Established in 1988","Managed by Adhiyamaan Educational and Research Institution Trust","Affiliated to Periyar University, Salem","NAAC B+ accredited","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) recognized","17 Undergraduate programmes","9 Postgraduate programmes","4 Ph.D research programmes","33,605+ library books","50+ national and international journals","250 e-journals and digital resources","Separate boys and girls hostel facilities","Dedicated Career and Placement Counselling Cell","5798+ students placed","61+ university gold medals","Research Council and IPR Cell","Industry-linked employability training programmes"],"departments":[{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc Computer Science - Artificial Intellig