e","title":"Vysya College - Arts & Science College in Salem | CollegeShine","description":"Vysya College is a private, trust-managed (vasavi vidya trust) arts & science college in Ramakrishnapuram, Masinaickenpatty, Ayodhiyapattinam established in.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Vysya-College-of-Education-collegeshine_47_11zon.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Vysya College","shortName":"Vysya College Salem","tagline":null,"category":"arts-science","type":"Arts and Science College","ownership":"Private, Trust-Managed (Vasavi Vidya Trust)","established":"1990","location":"Ramakrishnapuram, Masinaickenpatty, Ayodhiyapattinam","district":"Salem","address":"Ramakrishnapuram, Masinaickenpatty, Ayodhiyapattinam (PO), Salem - 636103, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Vysya+College+Ramakrishnapuram+Salem","mapQuery":"Vysya College, Ramakrishnapuram, Masinaickenpatty, Salem","website":"https://www.vysyainfo.in/","phone":"0427-2240107","email":"principal@vysyaeducation.org","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Vysya-College-of-Education-collegeshine_47_11zon.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Periyar University, Salem","accreditation":["NAAC Accredited","UGC 2(f) and 12(B)"],"about":"Vysya College was founded in 1990 by the Vasavi Vidya Trust, formed by seven executive trustees and ten members from Salem''s Vysya community. The decision to start a college (rather than another school) was taken at a trust conference on 6 July 1989, land was registered on 2 November 1989 in Masinaickenpatty village, Ayothiapattinam, and the foundation for the institution was laid on 25 January 1990, with government sanction (G.O. No. 762/1990) granted the same year as a self-financing college. It is co-educational, affiliated to Periyar University, Salem, re-accredited by NAAC, and recognized under sections 2(f) and 12(B) of the UGC Act.\\n\\nSituated on a 17.48-acre campus roughly 2 km from Ayothiyapattinam and 10 km from Salem''s New Bus Stand, the college enrolls around 2,001 students supported by a faculty of 66, offering 22 courses across 9 degree programmes in Business Administration, Computer Applications, Commerce, Science, and Arts. The college provides separate hostel facilities for boys and girls with RO-water systems and backup generators, dedicated laboratories for Biotechnology, Biochemistry, Microbiology, Botany, Zoology, and Computer Science, industry-relevant certification programmes in Java, .NET, Python, and Tally, and operates more than 30 buses across routes including Attur, Dharmapuri, Kadathur, Boomidi, and Tharamangalam.","highlights":["17.48-acre campus","2,001 students, 66 faculty","22 courses across 9 degree programmes","30+ college buses covering multiple routes","Certification programmes in Java, .NET, Python, Tally"],"departments":[{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"},{"name":null,"level":"UG"}],"facilities":["Library","Smart Classrooms with LCD Projectors","Separate Boys'' and Girls'' Hostels","Solar and Generator Backup Power","Specialized Science Labs","College Bus Transport (30+ buses)"],"placementRate":0,"avgPackage":null,"highestPackage":null,"placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":["Admission primarily via written test and interview","Academic performance in qualifying exam is the primary criterion","Class 12 or equivalent required for UG programmes"],"scholarships":[],"events":[],"distanceInfo":{"nearestLandmark":"Ayothiyapattinam - approximately 2 km","nearestBusStand":"Salem New Bus Stand - approximately 10 km","nearestRailway":"Salem Railway Station - approximately 14 km","nearestAirport":"Salem Kamalapuram Airport - approximately 35.6 km"},"hostelFeatures":["Separate hostels for boys and girls","RO water facility","Generator and solar backup","Facilities extended to accommodate international students"],"technicalClubs":[],"culturalClubs":[],"communityService":["NSS (3 units)","Rotary Club tie-up","Consumer Club","Sapling Club","Committee for Students with Disability"]}'),
