es, particularly to students from rural and economically developing communities. The college is located approximately 6 kilometres from the Dharmapuri-Salem Bypass and has a campus reported at around 60 acres.\\n\\nThe college is a co-educational institution affiliated to Periyar University, Salem. Publicly available course records list undergraduate, postgraduate and research-level programmes across Arts, Science, Commerce, Computer Applications and Management. The institution provides classrooms, seminar facilities, laboratories, workshops, library resources, sports and student-support facilities. The college''s academic profile includes programmes such as B.A. English, B.A. Tamil, B.Sc. Chemistry, B.Sc. Computer Science, B.Sc. Mathematics, B.Sc. Physics, BCA, BBA, B.Com., M.Sc. Chemistry, M.Sc. Mathematics, M.Sc. Physics and M.Com., along with research programmes.","highlights":["60-Acre Campus","Established 1999","Periyar University Affiliation","Co-Educational Institution","Rural Education Focus","UG Programmes","PG Programmes","Research Programmes","Laboratory Facilities","Library Facilities","Seminar Facilities","Sports Facilities"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"UG"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Applications","level":"UG"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Science Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar Hall"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Computer Laboratory"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Hostel Facility"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":