('government-arts-college-coimbatore','government-arts-college-coimbatore','Government Arts College, Coimbatore','GAC Coimbatore','arts-science','Government Autonomous','Government of Tamil Nadu','1852','Coimbatore','Coimbatore','Government Arts College Road, Coimbatore - 641018, Tamil Nadu','https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Government+Arts+College+Coimbatore','https://gacbe.ac.in','(0422) 2215212','govtartscoimbatore18@gmail.com','https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Government-Arts-College-Coimbatore-collegeshine_24_11zon-150x150.webp','Government Arts College, Coimbatore | Coimbatore - CollegeShine','Government Arts College, Coimbatore is a government of tamil nadu arts & science college in Coimbatore established in 1852. Sapere Aude — Dare to be Wise.',NULL, '{"id":"government-arts-college-coimbatore","seo":{"metaTitle":"Government Arts College, Coimbatore | Coimbatore - CollegeShine","metaDescription":"Government Arts College, Coimbatore is a government of tamil nadu arts & science college in Coimbatore established in 1852. Sapere Aude — Dare to be Wise.","metaKeywords":["Government Arts College","Coimbatore","GAC Coimbatore","Government Arts College","Coimbatore admission 2026","Government Arts College","Coimbatore fees","Government Arts College","Coimbatore courses","Arts & Science colleges in Coimbatore","Coimbatore","Arts & Science","Government of Tamil Nadu","Government Autonomous","NAAC A Grade","UGC 2(f) & 12(B)","Autonomous Status since 1987","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","Tamil","English","History","Economics","Mathematics","Physics"],"canonicalUrl":null,"robots":"index, follow","h1":"Government Arts College, Coimbatore","openGraph":{"title":"Government Arts College, Coimbatore | Coimbatore - CollegeShine","description":"Government Arts College, Coimbatore is a government of tamil nadu arts & science college in Coimbatore established in 1852. Sapere Aude — Dare to be Wise.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-cont