ived autonomous status in 1987 and is affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore. It continues to function as a Government institution under the Government of Tamil Nadu.\\n\\nThe college is located on Arts College Road in central Coimbatore and provides undergraduate, postgraduate and research education across Arts, Science, Commerce, Computer Applications and related disciplines. The institution has 23 departments, a library with more than 34,000 books, departmental libraries, digital library facilities and extensive computer infrastructure. The college also provides hostel facilities for men and women, sports, auditorium, canteen, museum, green house and other student-support facilities.\\n\\nGovernment Arts College has an active placement cell that conducts campus and off-campus recruitment drives, career guidance programmes, soft-skill training and job fairs. Its 2025 placement records include recruitment activities involving TCS, Accenture, Sutherland, Eveready, Deloitte and other organisations. The college is ranked 67th in the NIRF 2025 College category and continues to support higher education opportunities for students from diverse social and economic backgrounds.","highlights":["Established in 1852","Government institution","Autonomous since 1987","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","NIRF Rank 67 in 2025","NAAC A Grade","23 Academic Departments","34,135+ Library Books","400 Computers","Separate Boys and Girls Hostel","Active Placement Cell","UG, PG and Research Programmes"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce with Computer Applications","level":"PG"},{"name":"Business Administration","level":"UG"},{"name":"Political Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Public Administration","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Geography","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Information Technology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Applications","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Statistics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Psychology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Tourism and Travel Management","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Defence Studies","level":"UG"},{"name":"Physical Education","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Training Centre"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Language Lab"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-light-bulb","name":"NSS Activities"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Science Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transport Access"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Student Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-coffee","name":"Canteen"},{"icon":"ti-store","name":"Cooperative Store"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Infotech Hall"},{"icon":"ti-accessibility","name":"Divyangjan Facility"},{"icon":"ti-museum","name":"Museum"},{"icon":"ti-leaf","name":"Green House"},{"icon":"ti-leaf","name":"Herbal Garden"},{"icon":"ti-cpu","name":"Common Instrumentation Centre"},{"icon":"ti-database","name":"Research Database"},{"icon":"ti-bookmark","name":"Digital Library"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Reading Room"}],"placementRate":18.69,"avgPackage":"₹3.2 LPA","highestPackage":"₹6.5 LPA","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Online Application","desc":"Applicants register through the Tamil Nadu Government Arts and Science Colleges Admission system and submit their programme preferences."},{"title":"Merit Preparation","desc":"Admission is based on merit subject to the Government of Tamil Nadu reservation policy."},{"title":"Rank List","desc":"Eligible applicants are arra