eritage character of Stone House Hill.\\n\\nThe college offers undergraduate, postgraduate and research programmes across Arts, Commerce and Science disciplines. It is affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore and provides higher education opportunities to students from the Nilgiris and surrounding communities. The institution provides library, hostel, placement, laboratory, student welfare, NSS and other academic and extension facilities.\\n\\nThe college''s academic history includes the introduction of undergraduate programmes from the late 1950s, postgraduate programmes from the 1980s and research programmes across multiple departments. The official website lists UG, PG, M.Phil and Ph.D programmes and maintains department-wise academic information.","highlights":["Established in 1955","Historic Stone House Hill Campus","Major Higher Education Centre in Nilgiris","Government of Tamil Nadu Institution","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","NAAC B Grade Accredited","UG and PG Programmes","Research Programmes","One Lakh Plus Library Volumes","Hostel Facility Available","Placement Cell Active","NSS and Student Welfare Activities"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Tourism & Travel Management","level":"UG"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Defence Studies","level":"UG"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce CA","level":"PG"},{"name":"Commerce IB","level":"PG"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Electronics & Communication System","level":"UG"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Wild Life Biology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"Geology","level":"UG"},{"name":"MCA","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"