 of Excellence.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Kongunadu-Arts-and-Science-College-Coimbatore-150x150.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"Kongunadu Arts and Science College | Coimbatore - CollegeShine","description":"Kongunadu Arts and Science College is a private, autonomous arts & science college in G.N. Mills, Coimbatore established in 1973. A UGC College of Excellence.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Kongunadu-Arts-and-Science-College-Coimbatore-150x150.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"Kongunadu Arts and Science College","shortName":"KASC","tagline":"A UGC College of Excellence in Coimbatore since 1973","category":"arts-science","type":"Co-educational, Autonomous","ownership":"Private, Autonomous","established":1973,"location":"G.N. Mills, Coimbatore","district":"Coimbatore","address":"G.N. Mills Post, Coimbatore - 641029, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Kongunadu+Arts+and+Science+College+GN+Mills+Coimbatore","mapQuery":"Kongunadu Arts and Science College, G.N. Mills Post, Coimbatore","website":"https://kongunaducollege.ac.in/","phone":" +91 98655 53429","email":"","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Kongunadu-Arts-and-Science-College-Coimbatore-150x150.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Bharathiar University, Coimbatore","accreditation":["NAAC A+ Grade (4th cycle)","UGC College of Excellence","AICTE","Autonomous status"],"about":"Kongunadu Arts and Science College (KASC) is a co-educational, autonomous institution located at G.N. Mills in Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu. Founded on 12 August 1973 to meet the growing demand for higher education in the fast-industrialising Kongunadu region, the college is affiliated to Bharathiar University and has since developed into one of the larger autonomous arts and science colleges in the district.\\n\\nThe college received Autonomous status from the University Grants Commission in the 2004-05 academic year and has been re-accredited by NAAC with an A+ grade in its fourth accreditation cycle. It has also been recognised as a College of Excellence by the UGC. KASC has featured in the NIRF overall ranking framework, placing in the 101-150 band in the 2025 edition.\\n\\nKASC offers undergraduate, postgraduate and research programmes across Arts, Science, Commerce and Computer Applications, including newer disciplines such as Computer Science with Data Analytics and Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning, supported by dedicated undergraduate, postgraduate and research laboratories across its departments.","highlights":["Established on 12 August 1973","Autonomous status granted by UGC in 2004-05","Re-accredited by NAAC with A+ grade (4th cycle)","Recognised as a UGC College of Excellence (2016-17)","Featured in NIRF 101-150 band ranking (2025)","Affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore","Departments spanning Physics, Chemistry, Biotechnology, Computer Science, Commerce and more","Dedicated UG, PG and research laboratories across departments","Newer programmes in Data Analytics and AI & Machine Learning","Active departmental symposiums, seminars and industry outreach"],"departments":[{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PG"},{"name":"Computer Science with Data Analytics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning","level":"UG"},{"name":"Biotechnology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PG"},{"name":"Costume Design and Fashion","level":"UG"},{"name":"English","level":"PG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Campus Wi-Fi"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Laborat