amuthu Gounder and Arutchelvar Dr. N. Mahalingam. The college began as a Pre-University institution and developed into a full-fledged degree college before attaining postgraduate and autonomous status. It is affiliated to Bharathiar University and has developed into a postgraduate teaching and research institution.\\n\\nNGM College offers aided and self-financing undergraduate, postgraduate and research-oriented programmes across Arts, Science, Commerce, Management, Information Technology, Computer Applications and Human Excellence. The college maintains dedicated academic departments, laboratories, ICT-enabled classrooms, library resources, sports facilities, research infrastructure and student development activities. Its Training and Placement Cell, established in 2003, conducts career counselling, mock interviews, group discussions, professional development programmes, campus-connect activities and industry interaction.","highlights":["Established in 1957","Autonomous college","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","NIRF 2025 College Category Rank Band 101-150","NIRF 2021 College Rank #72","26-acre campus","Postgraduate teaching and research institution","UG, PG and research programmes","98 well-furnished classrooms","Automated digital library","Training and Placement Cell established in 2003","SWAYAM-NPTEL Local Chapter since 2017"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English Literature","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Information Technology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Applications","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Artificial Intelligence & Machine Learning","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Science with Data Analytics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Comput