ed arts & science college in Civil Aerodrome Post, Coimbatore established in 1947. Knowledge.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sri-PSG-Arts-and-Science-College-for-Women-collegshine_34_11zon-300x239.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"PSG College of Arts and Science | Coimbatore - CollegeShine","description":"PSG College of Arts and Science is a private, government-aided arts & science college in Civil Aerodrome Post, Coimbatore established in 1947. Knowledge.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sri-PSG-Arts-and-Science-College-for-Women-collegshine_34_11zon-300x239.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"PSG College of Arts and Science","shortName":"PSG CAS","tagline":"Knowledge, Love and Work — a premier institution of the PSG & Sons Charities since 1947","category":"arts-science","type":"Co-educational, Autonomous","ownership":"Private, Government-Aided","established":1947,"location":"Civil Aerodrome Post, Coimbatore","district":"Coimbatore","address":"PSG College of Arts & Science, Civil Aerodrome Post, Coimbatore - 641014, Tamil Nadu","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=PSG+College+of+Arts+and+Science+Avinashi+Road+Civil+Aerodrome+Post+Coimbatore","mapQuery":"PSG College of Arts and Science, Avinashi Road, Civil Aerodrome Post, Coimbatore","website":"https://www.psgcas.ac.in/","phone":"0422-4303300","email":"principal@psgcas.ac.in","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/Sri-PSG-Arts-and-Science-College-for-Women-collegshine_34_11zon-300x239.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Bharathiar University, Coimbatore","accreditation":["NAAC A++ Grade","UGC College with Potential for Excellence","DBT Star College Status","ISO 9001:2015 Certified Institution","Autonomous College","Affiliated to Bharathiar University"],"about":"PSG College of Arts & Science (PSGCAS) was established in 1947 under the PSG & Sons Charities Trust and has developed into a major autonomous institution for Arts, Science, Commerce and Management education in Coimbatore. The college is affiliated to Bharathiar University and provides undergraduate, postgraduate, integrated and research programmes across a wide range of disciplines.\\n\\nPSGCAS has a strong academic and research ecosystem supported by modern laboratories, a central research laboratory, digital learning resources, a large central library, sports infrastructure, student hostels, health-care support, counselling services and career development facilities. The institution is recognised by the UGC as a College with Potential for Excellence and holds DBT Star College Status. The college is accredited with A++ Grade by NAAC in its fourth cycle and is ISO 9001:2015 certified.\\n\\nThe college has consistently performed strongly in the National Institutional Ranking Framework. PSGCAS was ranked #11 among colleges in India in NIRF 2024 and improved to #10 in NIRF 2025. Its Career Development Center reports more than 200 recruiters and more than 2,100 offers in 2024-25, demonstrating strong industry engagement and placement support.","highlights":["Established in 1947","Autonomous College","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","NAAC A++ Grade Accredited","Ranked #10 among Colleges in India in NIRF 2025","UGC College with Potential for Excellence","DBT Star College Status","ISO 9001:2015 Certified Institution","13050+ Students","143 Permanent Faculty Members","200+ Recruiters","2100+ Placement Offers"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Sociology","level":"UG"},{"name":"Psychology","level":"PG"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Statistics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name"