, Coimbatore established in 1963. Educate to.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/PSGR-Krishnammal-College-for-Women-collegshine_44_11zon-150x150.webp","type":"website","url":null},"twitterCard":{"card":"summary_large_image","title":"PSGR Krishnammal College for Women | Coimbatore - CollegeShine","description":"PSGR Krishnammal College for Women is a private, grant-in-aid, autonomous arts & science college in Peelamedu, Coimbatore established in 1963. Educate to.","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/PSGR-Krishnammal-College-for-Women-collegshine_44_11zon-150x150.webp"},"structuredData":{"schemaType":"CollegeOrUniversity","jsonLd":null,"includeFaqSchema":true,"includeBreadcrumbSchema":true}},"name":"PSGR Krishnammal College for Women","shortName":"PSGRKCW","tagline":"Educate to Empower — a GRG Trust institution for women since 1963","category":"arts-science","type":"Women''s College, Autonomous","ownership":"Private, Grant-in-Aid, Autonomous","established":1963,"location":"Peelamedu, Coimbatore","district":"Coimbatore","address":"Peelamedu, Coimbatore - 641004, Tamil Nadu, India","mapLink":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=PSGR+Krishnammal+College+for+Women+Peelamedu+Coimbatore","mapQuery":"PSGR Krishnammal College for Women, Peelamedu, Coimbatore","website":"https://www.psgrkcw.ac.in/","phone":"+91 422 429 5959 / 5860","email":"","image":"https://collegeshine.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/PSGR-Krishnammal-College-for-Women-collegshine_44_11zon-150x150.webp","videoUrl":"","affiliation":"Bharathiar University, Coimbatore","accreditation":["NAAC A++ Grade (CGPA 3.71)","UGC College of Excellence","Autonomous Institution","DBT Star College Status","ACBSP Accredited","DSIR Recognised"],"about":"PSGR Krishnammal College for Women (PSGRKCW) is an autonomous women''s institution located at Peelamedu, Coimbatore, Tamil Nadu. The college was inaugurated in June 1963 under the aegis of the GRG Trust and has grown over six decades as an institution focused on women''s higher education. The college follows the motto of empowering through education and is affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore.\\n\\nPSGRKCW has developed into a multidisciplinary institution offering more than 70 programmes across undergraduate, postgraduate, research, community college and other academic streams. The college website reports more than 425 faculty members and more than 8,500 students. Its infrastructure includes a 10-acre green campus, approximately 100 classrooms, 14 science laboratories, extensive library resources, computer facilities, digital learning infrastructure and multiple seminar and academic halls.\\n\\nThe institution has a strong research and placement ecosystem. Its official placement information reports 341 students placed during 2023-24, with an average salary of ₹4.7 LPA and a maximum package of ₹26 LPA. The college''s research profile includes 373 SCOPUS/WoS publications and two patents as reported in its 2025 institutional document. PSGRKCW was ranked 9th among colleges in India in NIRF 2025.","highlights":["Founded in 1963 under the GRG Trust","Autonomous women''s college","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","NAAC A++ accredited","UGC College of Excellence","Ranked 9th among colleges in India in NIRF 2025","70+ academic programmes","425+ faculty members","8500+ students","10-acre green campus","14 science laboratories","80,000+ library volumes","Two or more thousand hostel accommodation capacity","373 SCOPUS/WoS publications reported","Two patents reported","Strong industry-linked placement ecosystem"],"departments":[{"name":"B.A. Economics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. English Literature","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. History","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.B.A.","level":"PhD"},{"name":"B.Com.","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Botany","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":