 is a government-aided autonomous institution affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore. The college was founded in 1952 by philanthropist Sri G.V. Govindaswamy Naidu and has been imparting quality education to rural women students with the motto ''Not for self, but for all''. The institution has developed into a multidisciplinary higher education centre offering undergraduate, postgraduate and research programmes across Arts, Science, Commerce and Management.\\n\\nThe college has maintained a strong record in quality assurance, autonomous academic development, research and student support. Its official institutional records state that the college received A+ accreditation in the fourth NAAC cycle with a CGPA of 3.27 in 2019. The institution is also ISO 9001:2015 certified, has received DBT Star College status, DST-FIST and DST-CURIE support, and has been identified as a mentor institution under the UGC Paramarsh scheme.\\n\\nThe institution provides laboratories, library facilities, indoor stadium, auditorium, conference facilities, hostel, internet facilities and student-support services. The college also operates a full-fledged Career Guidance and Placement Cell and reports placements in organisations including Wipro, TCS, Infosys and Tech Mahindra. Its library maintains more than 60,000 books together with journals, digital resources, DELNET, N-LIST and other learning resources.","highlights":["Established in 1952","Government-aided autonomous women''s institution","Affiliated to Bharathiar University","23 UG and 8 PG programmes","NAAC A+ Grade in Fourth Cycle","NAAC CGPA 3.27 in 2019","UGC 2(f) and 12(B) recognised","ISO 9001:2015 certified institution","DBT Star College status","DST-FIST and DST-CURIE supported institution","UGC Paramarsh mentor institution","Career Guidance and Placement Cell"],"departments":[{"name":"Tamil","level":"PhD"},{"name":"English","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Economics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"History","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Mathematics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physics","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Chemistry","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Zoology","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Commerce","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Botany","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Physical Education","level":"UG"},{"name":"Tamil Literature","level":"UG"},{"name":"English Literature","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Science","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Computer Applications","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Computer Science (Artificial Intelligence)","level":"UG"},{"name":"BBA (Computer Applications)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com (Computer Applications)","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com","level":"UG"},{"name":"Information Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"Statistics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Logistics & Freight Management","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com (Professional Accounting)","level":"UG"},{"name":"Business Analytics","level":"UG"},{"name":"Computer Science (AI)","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.Phil. Programmes","level":"PhD"},{"name":"Ph.D. Programmes","level":"PhD"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Internet Facility"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"ICT Enabled Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-home","name":"Women''s Hostel"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Counselling Services"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Career Guidance & Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Auditorium"},{"icon":"ti-users","name":"Conference Halls"},{"icon":"ti-soccer","name":"Indoor Stadium"},{"icon":"ti-credit-card","name":"ATM Facility"},{"icon":"ti-car","name":"Parking Facility"},{"icon":"ti-leaf","name":"Environmental Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-bookmark","name":"Digital Learning Resources"}],"placementRate":"Available","avgPackage":"₹3.00 LPA","highestPackage":"Available","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"Review the programme-specific eligibility requirements prescribed by the college and Bharathiar University."},{"title":"Application","desc":"Submit the application through the admission process provided by the college for the selected programme."},{"title":"Merit Selection","desc":"Eligible applicants are considered according to the admission and merit regulations applicable to the programme."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Complete verification of academic certificates, transfer certificate, community certificate and other required documents."},{"title":"Fee Payment","desc":"Complete the prescribed fee payment and admission formalities after selection."},{"title":"Enrollment","desc":"Report to the college and complete the required enrollment and academic registration procedures."}],"scholarships":["Government Scholarships","Post-Matric Scholarships","Financial Assistance","Sports Scholarship","Management Financial Assistance","SC/ST Educational Assistance","BC/MBC Scholarship","Minority Scholarship","Merit Assistance","Government Welfare Schemes"],"events":["College Union Activities","Independence Day Celebration","Republic Day Celebration","Founders Day Celebration","College Day Celebration","Teachers Day Celebration","Onam Celebration","Pongal Celebration","Sports Activities","NSS Activities","NCC Activities","Youth Red Cross Activities","Career Guidance Programmes","Students Induction Programme","Seminars and Guest Lectures"],"distanceInfo":{"airport":"Available","railway":"Available","bustand":"Available","metro":"Not Available","hospital":"Available"},"hostelFeatures":["Women''s Hostel","Hostel Accommodation","Dining Facility","Security","Warden Support","Study Facilities","Residential Support","Student Welfare"],"technicalClubs":["Computer Science Club","Information Technology Activities","Artificial Intelligence Activities","Business Analytics Activities","Research Cell","Institution''s Innovation Council","Digital Learning Activities"],"culturalClubs":["English Literary Association","Senthamizh Mandram","Fine Arts Club","College Union","Band