ore than five decades.\\n\\nThe college offers nine undergraduate and four postgraduate programmes under its Government Aided stream, along with research programmes leading to M.Phil. and Ph.D. qualifications. The 2023-2024 annual report records 1,083 students on roll, 68 permanent faculty members and active research programmes. The institution also maintains a central library, laboratories, digital learning resources, Wi-Fi campus facilities, sports infrastructure, NSS, NCC, Youth Red Cross, placement and career guidance activities and multiple student clubs and associations.\\n\\nSri Vasavi College has been accredited by NAAC with a B Grade in its second cycle with a CGPA of 2.50. The institution has participated in the National Institutional Ranking Framework and is listed by the Ministry of Education in the NIRF College rankings. The 2023-2024 annual report records 17 Ph.D. scholars completing their programmes, 7 M.Phil. completions, 24 new Ph.D. registrations, 60 M.Phil.-approved guides and 52 Ph.D.-approved guides.","highlights":["Established in 1967 under Erode Vidya Sangam","Government-aided co-educational institution","Affiliated to Bharathiar University, Coimbatore","NAAC Second Cycle B Grade with 2.50 CGPA","Listed in NIRF India Rankings","1,083 students recorded on roll in 2023-2024","68 permanent faculty members recorded in 2023-2024","Nine undergraduate and four postgraduate aided programmes","Active M.Phil. and Ph.D. research programmes","53,787 books recorded in the college library"],"departments":[{"name":"B.A. Economics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. History","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.A. English","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Mathematics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Chemistry","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Zoology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Computer Science","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.B.A.","level":"PhD"},{"name":"B.Com.","level":"UG"},{"name":"M.A. History","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Mathematics","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Sc. Zoology","level":"PG"},{"name":"M.Com.","level":"PG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Maths with Accountancy","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Maths with Physics","level":"UG"},{"name":"BCA","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Electronics","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Costume Design and Fashion","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Sc. Information Technology","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com. CA","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com. PA","level":"UG"},{"name":"B.Com. CS","level":"UG"}],"facilities":[{"icon":"ti-wifi","name":"Wi-Fi Enabled Campus"},{"icon":"ti-books","name":"Central Library"},{"icon":"ti-desktop","name":"Computer Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-blackboard","name":"Smart Classrooms"},{"icon":"ti-heart","name":"Gymnasium"},{"icon":"ti-cup","name":"Cafeteria"},{"icon":"ti-bus","name":"Transportation Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-trophy","name":"Sports Facilities"},{"icon":"ti-microphone","name":"Seminar and Conference Halls"},{"icon":"ti-crown","name":"Career Guidance and Placement Cell"},{"icon":"ti-flask","name":"Science Laboratories"},{"icon":"ti-world","name":"Digital Library and E-Resources"}],"placementRate":"257 students placed in 2023-2024","avgPackage":"₹2.76 LPA median","highestPackage":"Data not officially published","placementYear":null,"admissionProcess":[{"title":"Check Eligibility","desc":"Candidates must satisfy the eligibility requirements prescribed for the selected programme by Bharathiar University and the college."},{"title":"Application Submission","desc":"Eligible candidates submit their application through the admission process specified by Sri Vasavi College for the relevant academic year."},{"title":"Merit-Based Selection","desc":"Admission to aided UG programmes is merit-based and follows Government of Tamil Nadu reservation and admission norms."},{"title":"Document Verification","desc":"Candidates submit qualifying examination records, transfer and community certificates and other documents required by the college."},{"title":"Counselling and Selection","desc":"Eligible a